// Ch6 B09, side scene (optional): "The Burned Lamp" (act1_ch06.md §4; W16). In-engine, opened by the
// tideline marker below the camp at dusk. Liss digs a hole in the wet sand with a hull-scraper; beside
// her a scorched lamp housing, its salt-glass crazed, a name scratched on its collar under her thumb.
// Rules, every one (tests/integration/test_ch06_thread.gd checks the name):
//   - Nobody ever says whose name it was. The camera never reads the collar: one locked shot (W16)
//     and inserts on hands and sand only, never one that could read it.
//   - Rhen doesn't joke and says nothing about his father or his lantern.
//   - No more than four lines from Liss in a row.
//   - One faint glimmer_held mote slips out of the sand and drifts seaward, down the beach, into the
//     water. Neither of them looks at it (bible §2, §7: Saltwrights hold their dead too; never said).
// Sets ch06_saw_lamp_buried; digging without asking sets ch06_dug_without_asking (Ch11's truce).
title: ch06_burned_lamp
location: ch06/brine_shoals
---
@camera W16
@music silence fade=2.0
@sfx tide_ambience
@anim liss dig_sand
@wait 1.5
Liss [neutral]: Don't touch that. #line:ch06_lamp_001
-> Whose was it? #line:ch06_lamp_002
    Liss [cold]: Don't. #line:ch06_lamp_003
    @mark rhen tideline_sit walk
    @anim rhen sit
    @wait 1.5
-> (Kneel and dig beside her.) #line:ch06_lamp_004
    @anim rhen dig_sand
    @wait 2.5
    @anim liss hand_over rhen
    <<set $ch06_dug_without_asking = true>>
    @wait 1.0
Liss [sad]: Housing's cracked at the seam. Burner side's fused. Seals gone. She'd not hold. #line:ch06_lamp_005
@wait 1.5
Liss [grief]: She'd never hold again. #line:ch06_lamp_006
@anim liss set_in_hole lamp_hole
@anim liss flatten_sand
@vfx glimmer_held at=lamp_hole drift=down_seaward count=1
@wait 3.0
Rhen [neutral]: In Oruvel we'd hang a lamp on a mooring line. For the ones who didn't come up. #line:ch06_lamp_007
Liss [neutral]: We put them to work. That's how we keep them. #line:ch06_lamp_008
Rhen [neutral]: And when they break? #line:ch06_lamp_009
Liss [neutral]: Then you dig. #line:ch06_lamp_010
@anim liss stand
@wait 1.0
Liss [neutral]: You didn't see this, diver. #line:ch06_lamp_011
Rhen [neutral]: See what. #line:ch06_lamp_012
@face liss soft_smile 0.6
@wait 1.0
<<set $ch06_saw_lamp_buried = true>>
===
